  "source_boundary": "ASTIS-authored analytic integration for pinned PBPS2609.06905v1 C.1 actual reflected density A3.Ex1 physical4581-4587, A3.Ex2 4589-4595 and normalized-density differentiation A3.E1 4597-4604; smooth compact core4573-4576 and C.2 physical4654-4664 toward B.13 physical3779-3786. This is not printed standalone theorem.",
  "actual_objects": "At EVERY y: mu=volume.tilted(-V), R_y=mu.tilted(-norm(x-y)^2/(2eta)), literal SOURCE S_y=volume.tilted(-V((y+u)/2)-norm(y-u)^2/(8eta)). Simultaneously prove actual S_y=(2x-y)#R_y and literal S_y compact mean C1. No arbitrary AE conditional version.",
  "source_extension": "Explicit sufficient-background generalization: finite real Hilbert/Borel E including rank0, C2 V with positive global lower Hessian, eta>0, signed compact C1 f. Original paper also has upper Hessian beta and beta*eta<=1 and smooth compact f. Upper bound and step cap are not needed for this analytic edge; genuine paper consumer retains them. This is attributed background extension, never replacement of B.13 assumptions.",
